 matrix of the linear transformation $\\,T,$ find $\\,T(v).$\n\n| $T(v)=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "Using the fact that $\\,T(v)=T\\cdot v\\,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T(v) & =T\\cdot v \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & 7 \\\\ -3 & 4\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-7 \\\\ -19\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-317054/field-1" "q-317054/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "dd0537f8-b091-580a-974e-8e928d54939d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-317054"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-317058/field-1/59cabed12271767d3647412725d382bc72464274dc4ac46b4e7903c969156a02" :answer/id #uuid "c11ee060-d75e-5c05-a0d8-6344c1cd5bb4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "19" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-317058/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "5871fd75-224e-5e41-a363-3e83b8f3d45d" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-317058/field-1/59cabed12271767d3647412725d382bc72464274dc4ac46b4e7903c969156a02" :answer-field/choices ["q-317058/field-1/59cabed12271767d3647412725d382bc72464274dc4ac46b4e7903c969156a02"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-317058/field-2/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133" :answer/id #uuid "e7d94492-dc6f-5d2d-bc9e-358d8da223a4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-317058/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "743fe4a8-5ad2-5461-a5ed-cc163d754473" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-317058/field-2/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133" :answer-field/choices ["q-317058/field-2/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133"] :d