 {:db/id "q-74935" :question/id #uuid "b0bbc0eb-9d91-592b-9084-4e86e05ea6ac" :question/math-academy-id "q-74935" :question/problem "Consider the matrix $T$ and the vector $v$ given below. If $T$ is the standard matrix of the linear transformation $T,$ find $T(v).$\n\n$$\nT=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}],\\,v=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using the fact that $\\,T(v)=T\\cdot v,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T(v) & =T\\cdot v \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 7 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-74935/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "dd0537f8-b091-580a-974e-8e928d54939d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-74935"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-317055/field-1/6d8a7c7e73b503e82ee3fdeaeeda8131c0106d9ecb6a16ba218483b62acd0090" :answer/id #uuid "79053cd7-8760-5899-bedd-f5e9eed3f0c4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-18" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-317055/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "a3ad97d1-b034-55b8-a78c-fe9a8bc96f36" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-317055/field-1/6d8a7c7e73b503e82ee3fdeaeeda8131c0106d9ecb6a16ba218483b62acd0090" :answer-field/choices ["q-317055/field-1/6d8a7c7e73b503e82ee3fdeaeeda8131c0106d9ecb6a16ba218483b62acd0090"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-317055/field-2/4644593a6ae896793c595e8a37cd468ba91be6a8038e715c4c88cddad1968793" :answer/id #uuid "ffcb6e1c-dc8a-57f3-9696-8d2f7bc58a44" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-16" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-317055/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "004852a1-7cde-50c7-a053-096a0d0712da" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-317055/field-2/4644593a6ae896793c595e8a37cd468ba91be6a8038e715c4c88cddad1968793" :answer-field/choices ["q-317055/field-2/4644593a6ae896793c595e8a37cd468ba91be6a8038e715c4c88cddad1968793"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-317055" :question/id #uuid "4ef0d5f0-0483-5fdb-a5ba-7ae5f859a52e" :question/math-academy-id "q-317055" :question/problem "Consider the matrix $T$ and the vector $v$ given below. \n\n$$\nT=[\\begin{aligned}6 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2\\end{aligned}],\\,v=[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 8\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nIf $\\,T\\,$ is the standard matrix of the linear transformation $\\,T,$ find $\\,T(v).$\n\n| $T(v)=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "Using the fact that $\\,T(v)=T\\cdot v\\,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T(v) & =T\\cdot v \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}6 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 8\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-18 \\\\ -16\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-317055/field-1" "q-317055/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "dd0537f8-b091-580a-974e-8e928d54939d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-317055"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-275661/field-1/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" :answer/id #uuid "237ef57b-4d4b-5836-8e9e-389a61529a17" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-275661/field-1/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "979d6f25-f891-5724-a886-0897191fc0e8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-275661/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "4dd9da9c-7a67-5e81-90f2-b069de676b04" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.t